{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S08的“却不想回头”和S09的“连那些气也肯再受”把人物尚未确定的心态说得过实，Y保留了更多心理上的暧昧与余地。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听音乐边扫屏幕的普通观众，X的重点加亮、话与感受的纵向交替，以及感受文字按音乐进程出现，让人更容易迅速抓住叙事转折，也更容易把具体音乐变化和人物心理对应起来。尤其X的感受不只是给情绪贴标签，还写出了声音质地、身体反应、情绪起伏和前后变化，细腻程度更高。Y在人物动机的保留和表达克制上略胜一筹，但右侧感受集中堆叠，缺少时间上的展开，容易让人读到一堆感受，却来不及把它们组织成音乐与人物共同推进的一件事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "75eba6df-6d9c-4a79-8981-f298cd0c12c9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T062634551358Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.765, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:27:43.327828+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4f89da6249b8c3b32aaa3019006b14832eddb248982308daa9c6355411762322", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31